:null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.dev4.official and v4.5.dev3.official (also in mono versions)\n- Not reproducible v4.5.dev2.official and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev4 - Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS 22.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (nvidia; 535.247.01) - AMD Ryzen 3 3200G with Radeon Vega Graphics (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAccesskit panics every time a menu opens, for example the items in the main menu or the extra scenes options button. It does not happen for context menus or choosing a rendering method. Opening windows works, I was able to use the command palette to open editor settings.\n\nThe crash only happens in single window mode.\n\nThe following console output is generated. I have set `RUST_BACKTRACE` to full, but it does not offer much information.\n\n```\nGodot Engine v4.5.dev4.mono.official.209a446e3 - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.3.242 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti\n\n\nthread '<unnamed>' panicked at /home/runner/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/accesskit_consumer-0.27.0/src/iterators.rs:406:45:\ncalled `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value\nstack backtrace:\n   0:          0x4ec60e2 - <unknown>\n   1:          0x4eac9a3 - <unknown>\n   2:          0x4ec5982 - <unknown>\n   3:          0x4ec5df3 - <unknown>\n   4:          0x4ec578d - <unknown>\n   5:          0x4ef3e95 - <unknown>\n   6:          0x4ef3e29 - <unknown>\n   7:          0x4ef42cc - <unknown>\n   8:           0x42683f - <unknown>\n   9:           0x42688b - <unknown>\n  10:           0x426b48 - <unknown>\n  11:          0x4e154f8 - <unknown>\n  12:          0x4e19094 - <unknown>\n  13:          0x4e16158 - <unknown>\n  14:          0x4e10ade - <unknown>\n  15:          0x1576ee2 - <unknown>\n  16:          0x28345f6 - <unknown>\n  17:           0x5342d9 - <unknown>\n  18:           0x42d0f9 - <unknown>\n  19:     0x7f7c03d59d90 - __libc_start_call_main\n                               at ./csu/../sysdeps/nptl/libc_start_call_main.h:58:16\n  20:     0x7f7c03d59e40 - __libc_start_main_impl\n                               at ./csu/../csu/libc-start.c:392:3\n  21:           0x463cfa - <unknown>\n  22:                0x0 - <unknown>\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n  1. Create an empty project\n  2. Enable single window mode in editor settings\n  3. Click on the scene button in the main menu \n\nNo other editor settings can be the cause of this crash, as I have deleted all my editor settings files and reproduced the issue this way.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106669/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url